			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 2D-animated anime style with hand-drawn ink outlines and cel shading, sakuga-quality high-frame animation, a wide shot frames two ninja warriors facing off on a shattered stone battlefield beneath a stormy dusk sky, their tattered cloaks whipping in the wind. The first ninja wears a blue headband and dark blue robes, the second a black hooded cloak with a red scarf. Blue and white energy swirl around their bodies in spiraling wisps, dust and small stones lifting off the cracked ground. The camera slowly arcs around the pair with medium amplitude at medium speed as they lower into combat stances, glaring at each other. [Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the camera cuts to an extreme close-up of the first ninja's raised palm, a violently spinning orb of compressed blue energy forming above his hand, jagged energy trails and sparks lashing outward, cracks spreading across the stone beneath his feet. The camera pushes in with large amplitude at fast speed as he grits his teeth and his eyes flare with blue glow. [Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts to the second ninja, white lightning-like energy crackling and hissing around his clenched fist, thin electric arcs snapping into the air, his body leaving faint afterimages as he shifts his weight. The camera arcs around him with medium amplitude at fast speed, the storm clouds above beginning to swirl in response to the gathering power. The second ninja (S2) roars in a fierce, gravelly voice: <d>[English] Thunder Fist!</d> [Shot 4] At 00:07.500, the camera cuts to a wide shot as both ninjas sprint toward each other at blinding speed, leaving long motion trails and kicking up dust, the first ninja (S1) shouting in a sharp, determined voice: <d>[English] Twister Ball!</d> They collide at the center of the frame, the blue orb and white lightning crashing together, and the entire scene freezes for a single slow-motion impact frame showing every particle, stone fragment, and energy spark suspended in mid-air with dramatic ink-brush shockwave lines radiating outward, before the explosion erupts in full force, a colossal dome of light and fire expanding, the camera shaking strongly with large amplitude as debris, dust, and embers blast outward. [Shot 5] At 00:10.500, the camera cuts to the aftermath, drifting smoke and glowing embers filling the air, the two ninja silhouettes visible through the haze, residual blue and white sparks crackling around them, one kneeling and breathing heavily while the other stands with his cloak still smoldering at the edges, the camera slowly pulling out at slow speed to reveal the scarred, steaming crater between them.\n\noverall_soundscape: Gales howl across the ruined battlefield while shattered stones grind and tumble. Energy orbs and lightning crackle with sharp electric hisses, fabric whips violently in the wind, rapid footsteps pound across the stone, and the final collision erupts in a deafening explosion followed by a deep rumble of settling debris and the soft crackle of embers.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Epic orchestral score with pounding taiko drums and fast-paced strings, building tension through rising brass ostinatos, then exploding into a full symphonic blast with choir and timpani precisely at the moment of impact, before fading into a low, tense drum roll and sustained cello note in the aftermath.",
				1344,
				768,
				73
			],
